OL,3,GNEWSANI economic growth rate 'needs to
OL,4,Adouble' for unification
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe average growth rate of the Northern
OL,7,FIreland economy would have to more than
OL,8,Fdouble to make Irish unification
OL,9,Feconomically sustainable, a new report
OL,10,Fsuggests.
OL,12,FThe analysis has been produced as part
OL,13,Fof "blueprint" on Irish unity published
OL,14,Fby Fine Gael, one of the main governing
OL,15,Fparties in the Republic of Ireland.
OL,17,FProf Stephen Kinsella, an economist,
OL,18,Fsaid the additional growth would be
OL,19,Fneeded to generate the tax revenues to
OL,20,Fcover the costs of transition to a
OL,21,Funified state.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
